{
  "$comment": "atelier \u2014 an exhibition catalogue. One hairline runs the full height of the sheet; section numerals sit on it in the margin. No accent colour at all, no boxes, no fills, no bullet glyphs: the only devices are the rail, the numerals, and a deliberately narrow measure. Restraint is the whole idea, so resist adding anything here.",
